beyondthestars.gui.homogeny.info.mix=§eMIX §7A mega mixer: Raw Star Matter 100 : 1 into Excited Stellar Plasma Mixture at T1, Degenerate Stellar Mixture at T2, Entanglement Medium (for Reality Diffraction) at T3. No overclock: each parallel draws the recipe's EU/t. No ignition, no maintenance.
